{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":32,"alongside":33,"kin":34,"engines":59,"usedOn":60,"sites":61,"crewed":65,"museums":66,"hero":67},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/hubble.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":13,"description":31},"hubble","Hubble空间望远镜","observatory","NASA / ESA","USA / Multi (Europe)","Lockheed Martin / Perkin-Elmer","1990-04-24","ACTIVE","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","标志性可见光/紫外线空间望远镜；5 次维修任务","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Hubble Space Telescope — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hubble_Space_Telescope","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Hubble — NASA","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/hubble/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"The Space Telescope: A Study of NASA, Science, Technology, and Politics (Smith)","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/highlights_of_hubbles_exploration_of_the_universe_0.pdf","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":3},"earth-object","NASA 和 ESA 共同运营的可见光/紫外线空间望远镜，自 1990 年以来在低地球轨道运行，并通过 Space Shuttle 任务进行了 5 次维修，最后一次于 2009 年完成。35+ 年后仍在运作，主要仪器由进行舱外活动的宇航员安装，其主镜的缺陷在 1993 年通过 COSTAR 得到纠正（后来被配有内置修正光学系统的仪器替代）。",[],[],[35,39,43,47,51,55],{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"jwst","James Webb空间望远镜","最大的红外空间望远镜；L2轨道",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"compton-gro","Compton Gamma Ray Observatory","NASA的四大观测站之一",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"chandra","Chandra X射线天文台","空间最尖锐的X射线图像",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"xmm-newton","XMM-Newton","ESA的旗舰X射线观测站",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"spitzer","Spitzer空间望远镜","红外大天文台；16 年数据",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"kepler","Kepler","发现了 2,700+ 颗系外行星",[],[],[62],{"type":30,"href":63,"name":4,"place":-1,"text":64},"/earth?id=hubble","这架望远镜改变了人类观察宇宙的方式。1990年发射时有一个有缺陷的镜面——在1993年由Space Shuttle宇航员进行了修复。自那以来已观测了140万个天体。已运行34年多。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/hubble/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
